# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Neuroglyphics — your vault is yours.
#
# This repo doubles as a vault template: once you clone it, this folder
# IS your vault. Everything you or the engine generates is ignored, so
# the clone stays a clean copy of the engine and `git pull` never has to
# fight your cards.
#
# Backing your vault up to your OWN private repo instead? Delete the
# "vault contents" block below — you want those files tracked. Never
# push them to a public fork: state.json holds your salt.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- vault contents (delete this block for a private backup repo) ---
.neuroglyphics/state.json
.neuroglyphics/bench.json
.neuroglyphics/ledger.md
.neuroglyphics/sealed/
.neuroglyphics/revealed/

Codex/
Constellations/
Templates/
Covenant.md
Wonder List.md
# --- end vault contents ---

# Obsidian workspace config — machine-specific
.obsidian/

# OS and editor cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
